flowchart TB
    U[User browser]
    DNS[Azure public IP and DNS]
    NSG[Network Security Group]
    VM[Azure Linux VM]
    NGINX[Nginx reverse proxy]
    WEB[React and Vite static frontend]
    FUNC[Azure Function App - proposed TinyFish API]
    STORE[Functions storage account]
    SB[(Supabase Auth and PostgreSQL)]
    TF[TinyFish API]

    U -->|HTTPS 443| DNS
    DNS --> NSG
    NSG -->|Allowed web traffic| VM
    VM --> NGINX
    NGINX -->|Static assets| WEB
    NGINX -->|API paths over HTTPS| FUNC
    FUNC -. runtime dependency .-> STORE
    FUNC -->|HTTPS| SB
    FUNC -->|HTTPS with server-side API key| TF
